    "description": "This software package offers a solution for epileptogenic zone network (EZN) diagnosis based on stimulation-induced seizures. Estimating the epileptogenic zone network (EZN) is an important part of the diagnosis of drug-resistant focal epilepsy and plays a pivotal role in treatment and intervention. Both invasive SEEG stimulation and non-invasive temporal interference (TI) stimulation are considered as a complementary approach. Inference step is based on STAN.",
